[00:01.290]Your words are paper-thin
[00:04.310]You play them like a tiny violin
[00:08.720]Underneath my skin
[00:10.960]I'm falling for the sound with no defense
[00:14.775]
[00:15.090]And I, I memorized
[00:17.730]My favorite lines
[00:19.770]And I play 'em over and over again
[00:22.790]Time after time, a long goodbye
[00:26.480]But it don't have to end
[00:28.599]
[00:29.970]Let the strings play and the bass drum roar
[00:33.250]Tell me you'll stay for one more encore
[00:36.690]Promise on hearts that you broke, this won't
[00:40.170]Be our la-la-la last song
[00:43.670]Let the bells ring, harmonies echo
[00:46.880]Carried by wings of the lies you told
